  SourceId: bYDXk9HUMKOuym9h
  Slug: witch
  DisplayName: Witch
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/classes/witch.webp
  Description: "You command powerful magic, not through study or devotion, but as
    an agent for an otherworldly patron that even you don't entirely understand.
    This entity might be a covert divinity, a powerful fey, an ancient spirit, or
    any other mighty supernatural being\u2014but its nature is likely as much a mystery
    to you as it is to others. Through a special familiar, your patron grants you
    versatile spells and powerful hexes to use as you see fit, though you're never
    certain if you're merely serving your patron's larger plan. Witch"
